  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">About our brand and products:</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">CASALEO is a premium Pilates-focused brand for style-conscious women (20–40). We create high-quality, functional grip socks (and growing into Pilates equipment &amp; activewear) built for Reformer sessions and studio-to-street wear. </span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">What makes us different:</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">We blend strong performance with an aesthetic-first, minimal-yet-fun design language. Key differentiators: reliable grip, premium feel, and multiple sizes for a better fit—plus real studio/instructor proximity and community credibility. </span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">How affiliates can earn:</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Affiliates earn a competitive commission on validated net sales via a unique tracking link and/or discount code. High performers can unlock tiered perks like higher rates, bonuses, early drops, and exclusive collab opportunities.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">How to promote us:</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Create short-form UGC: Reformer clips, “no slipping” tests, outfit styling, unboxing, and “Pilates + coffee” lifestyle moments. Share your code/link in captions, Stories, bio, and pinned posts; highlight bundles and giftable sets.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Other information:</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">We provide a media kit (brand assets, product photos, key talking points) and support with best-performing angles. Please disclose ads (#ad), avoid medical/health claims, and keep messaging premium, clean, and honest—performance + aesthetics.</span></p></div></div>",
